- Ground truth: exact pre/post source extracted from `/opt/radare2` git (`git show 97f2d9cf5c^` and `97f2d9cf5c`). VULN/FIX functions verified at `elf.c:2565/2660/2688/2709/2740` and `bin_elf.inc:648`.
